    "reason": "[ev-8eb1c59d91de] describes `reportProperties` as a new opt-in rule field. Its custom entries go into the policy report results.properties. [ev-1519b599b779] and [ev-8777c5537c47] show the field being added at spec.rules[].reportProperties in the v1 schemas of both ClusterPolicy and Policy. The only environments that touch this addition are those with a ClusterPolicy or Policy rule that sets the field, which is exactly what the proposed any-of resource/field-set condition expresses. This matches known fact vf-8c91563114f9, which has the same applicability.",
